# Colorstorm Stallion's opus counts mana spent, not mana value: Force of Will has mana value 5 but Bot1 casts it for its
# alternative cost - 1 life and the exiled Brainstorm - so no mana is spent on it. On Bot2's turn 2, with Bot2's Duress on the stack,
# Bot1's Force of Will triggers the opus: the Stallion is a 4/4 until end of turn, but no copy is made (nothing was spent, CR 601.2h,
# 118.9). Force of Will counters the Duress. The control for a copy is the scenario in which five mana is spent.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Colorstorm Stallion
Force of Will
Brainstorm
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Duress
Swamp x18

